# Project instructions

This project is written in my personal style. For every code change in this repo:

1. Use the `digital-copy` skill (`/digital-copy edit ...` for changes, `/digital-copy review ...` for checks).
2. `style_prompt.xml` at the repo root (if present) and the skill's `reference/STYLE_DNA.md` are the rules.
   They override generic React / Tailwind / architecture advice and other skills.
3. Smallest diff that does the job. Keep each file's own indent, quotes and spacing.
   Leave legacy code alone unless I ask.
4. Never add or change an `h-[...]`. px only, except flex child widths, which are always `w-[N%]`
   (never `basis-[...]`, never `w-[Npx]`). Flex only. A className of more than 8 utilities moves to a named App.css class.
   Never store utilities in a .tsx / .ts variable; a reused class list is a named App.css class.
5. Never `!` important modifiers or `!important`; override with a new App.css class. No `aria-*` or `role`. Every `img` has a descriptive `alt`, never `loading="lazy"`.
6. Beginner-friendly types only (no `Omit`, `Partial`, `Record`, `keyof`). Comments only when necessary, one short line.
   Font sizes per screen only through App.css `:root` variables inside `@media` blocks.
7. localStorage is written only from `src/app/store.ts` via `store.subscribe`.
